Spec: JVM Agent-role interoperability fixture

Purpose:
  Exercise the Android-compatible transport implementation against a Windows publisher.

Owns:
  ./InteropClient.java

References:
  /transport-core/transport-core.sdd

Must:
  Generate a separate local key and CSR and report only public identity and transfer results.
  Keep software-key PKCS8 storage confined to this JVM fixture; Android production uses Keystore handles.
  Never describe this Agent-role fixture as an independent Android application or Binder acceptance.
